        "provider": "git"
      },
      "description": "Fixes silent no-op delta merges across the Markdown, YAML, and Plaintext parsers by invalidating stale cached serialization metadata (_inlines, _blockquoteChildren, _yaml) on mutated nodes and aligning PlaintextParser paragraph descriptors with value updates. Tightens applyDelta and validateRename to reject empty modified entries and rename operations targeting contains-only nodes without a name/label identifier. Adds an in-memory sequential effective-change check in ValidateArtifacts so every non-no-op delta operation must alter the serialized output relative to the preceding state."
    },
